<head>
<style>
table, td {
    border: 1px solid black;
    border-collapse: collapse;
}
td{
	padding:5px;
}
</style>
</head>

Dear Sir,
<br/>
<br/>
Please find details of a potential customer who has requirement of Full Truck Load services.
<br/>
Do contact the customer and take it forward.
<br/>
<br/>
<table>
	<tr>
		<td>SF Lead No</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.SF_Lead_No__c}</td>
		<td>Lead Name :</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Name}</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td>Lead Type</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Type__c}</td>
		<td>Contact Person Name</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Contact_Person_Name__c}</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td>Region</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Region__c}</td>
		<td>Status</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Status__c}</td>
		</tr>
	<tr>
		<td>Phone</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Phone__c}</td>
		<td>Email</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Email__c}</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td>Country</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Country__c}</td>
		<td>City</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.City__c}</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td>State</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.State__c}</td>
		<td>Address</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Street__c}</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td>Zip/Postal Code</td>
		<td>&nbsp;{!Lead__c.Zip_Postal_Code__c}</td>
	</tr>
</table>
